==================================================
16. HARD DEPLOYMENT GATE
==================================================

The calibration layer must NOT become production merely because it
looks better.

Promote it only if it demonstrates, on the untouched chronological
test set:

1. Better xP calibration than the current system.

2. Lower or equal xP MAE.

3. Lower or equal xP RMSE.

4. Improved cross-position calibration.

5. Reduced defender overprediction.

6. Reduced premium-attacker underprediction.

7. No catastrophic degradation for GKP/MID/FWD.

8. No evidence of leakage.

If the calibrated system does NOT beat the raw system, DO NOT deploy it.

Report:

DEPLOY
or
DO NOT DEPLOY

with numerical evidence.

